  "purpose": "One bounded learned 6x6 falsification of full-resolution boundary evidence plus current-layout-conditioned KEEP/closed-cycle utility. This signed artifact freezes code, metadata roster, corruption schedule, architecture, loss, selector and gates, but does not authorize opening organizer pixels or labels, training, MPS, DEV, holdout, terminal, competition test, Weco, production or submission.",
  "scientific_scope": {
    "claim_if_pass": "the small warm-start hard-cycle mechanism merits a separately preregistered 12x12 continuation",
